Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: am33xx: fix early timer OCP dependencies

The system timers initialize before the OCP supplier. Describe that ordering
without changing the timer clocks or disabling firmware dependency tracking.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://lkml.iu.edu/2606.3/02992.html]

--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/ti/omap/am33xx.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/ti/omap/am33xx.dtsi
@@ -709,6 +709,7 @@
 	timer@0 {
 		assigned-clocks = <&timer1_fck>;
 		assigned-clock-parents = <&sys_clkin_ck>;
+		post-init-providers = <&ocp>;
 	};
 };
 
@@ -723,5 +724,6 @@
 	timer@0 {
 		assigned-clocks = <&timer2_fck>;
 		assigned-clock-parents = <&sys_clkin_ck>;
+		post-init-providers = <&ocp>;
 	};
 };
